{"about_the_game":"You are an orphan. Adopted by a kind and caring healer, you are taught to run the shop. You do your best to help out - learning and becoming a true apprentice - when one day tragedy strikes! And you are forced to run the business yourself... <br><br>Something has happened to that healer now, but can you uncover the truth?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is the Chapter 1: Prologue ============</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Begin your study of the occult<br></li><li>Explore the main mission<br></li><li>Face 1 of 3 different sorcerous battle arenas sampling powerful, elemental sorcery<br></li><li>Uncover a few miss-able side-quests, cutscenes and easter eggs<br></li><li>Offer direct feedback to influence the next chapter of sorcery</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Call Spirit Magic</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" width=598 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/d29ada309ff6747a84dc94d0f7ea0f90.mp4?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Aid the spirits &amp; gain unique spells and sorceries!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Commune with entities</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.poster.avif?t=1688246443\" width=640 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1606000/extras/dc93aea9f641737e15c883518d40e2f3.webm?t=1688246443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama